29,"y":1477,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"선형,","x":1550,"y":1477,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"즉","x":1644,"y":1479,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"이기이라는 점이다. 왜냐하면, 최악의 경우 전체 n개의 항을 전부 살펴보아야 할 수 있","words":[{"text":"이기이라는","x":338,"y":1539,"width":173,"height":44},{"text":"점이다.","x":526,"y":1540,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"왜냐하면,","x":646,"y":1541,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"최악의","x":802,"y":1540,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"경우","x":919,"y":1541,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"전체","x":1000,"y":1540,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"n개의","x":1081,"y":1540,"width":86,"height":39},{"text":"항을","x":1185,"y":1541,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"전부","x":1272,"y":1542,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"살펴보아야","x":1353,"y":1541,"width":178,"height":40},{"text":"할","x":1545,"y":1541,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1594,"y":1541,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있","x":1646,"y":1542,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"기 때문이다. 리스트는 자주 커널 알고리즘에 의해 직접 시용된다. 그렇지만 리스트는 자","words":[{"text":"기","x":342,"y":1607,"width":25,"height":38},{"text":"때문이다.","x":385,"y":1605,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"리스트는","x":536,"y":1605,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"자주","x":675,"y":1606,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"커널","x":756,"y":1606,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"알고리즘에","x":833,"y":1606,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"의해","x":1015,"y":1606,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"직접","x":1096,"y":1605,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"시용된다.","x":1175,"y":1606,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"그렇지만","x":1337,"y":1607,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"리스트는","x":1492,"y":1606,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"자","x":1643,"y":1606,"width":35,"height":38}]},{"text":"주 스택이나 큐 같은 보다 강력한 자료구조를 구축하는 데 시용된다.","words":[{"text":"주","x":340,"y":1675,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"스택이나","x":384,"y":1671,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"큐","x":524,"y":1674,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":569,"y":1671,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"보다","x":644,"y":1671,"width":67